            script: [
              {sp:"ANNOUNCER", t:"Part 1. You will hear a woman who works at an employment agency talking to a man about jobs he could apply for. First, you have some time to look at questions 1 to 5. Now listen carefully and answer questions 1 to 5."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Good morning, thanks for coming in to see us here at the agency, Joe. I'm one of the agency representatives, and my name's Sally Baker."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Hi, Sally. I think we spoke on the phone, didn't we?"},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"That's right, we did. So, thank you for sending in your cv. We've had quite a careful look at it, and I think we have two jobs that might be suitable for you."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"OK."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"The first one is in a company based in North London. They're looking for an administrative assistant."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"OK, what sort of company is it?"},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Uh. They're called Home Solutions. And they design and make furniture."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Oh, I don't know much about that, but it sounds interesting."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Yes, well as I said, they want someone in their office, and looking at your past experience. It does look as if you fit quite a few of the requirements. So on your cv, it appears you've done some data entry."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Yes."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"So that's one skill they want. Then they expect the person they appoint to attend meetings and take notes there."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"OK, I've done that before, yes."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"And you'd need to be able to cope with general admin."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Filing, and keeping records and so on? That should be OK. And in my last job, I also had to manage the diary."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Excellent. That's something they want here too. I'd suggest you add it to your cv. I don't think you mentioned that, did you?"},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"No."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"So as far as the requirements go, they want good computer skills of course. And they particularly mention spreadsheets."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"That should be fine."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"And interpersonal skills, which would be something they'd check with your references."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"I think that should be OK, yes."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Hmm, and then they mention that they want someone who is careful and takes care with details. Just looking at your cv, I'd say you're probably all right there."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"I think so, yes. Do they want any special experience?"},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"I think they wanted some experience of teleconferencing."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Oh, I've got 3 years experience of that."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Uh huh, let's see. Yes, good. In fact they're only asking for at least one year, so that's great. So is that something that might interest you?"},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"It is, yes. The only thing is you said they were in North London, so it would be quite a long commute for me."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"OK."},
              {sp:"ANNOUNCER", t:"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 6 to 10. Listen and answer questions 6 to 10."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"So the second position might suit you better, as far as the location goes. Uh. That's for a warehouse assistant, and that's in South London."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Yes, that would be a lot closer."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"And you've worked in a warehouse before, haven't you?"},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Yes."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"So, as far as the responsibilities for this position go, they want someone who can manage the stock, obviously. And also deliveries."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"That should be OK. You've got to keep track of stuff, but I've always been quite good with numbers."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Good. That's their first requirement, and they want someone who's computer literate, which we know you are."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Sure."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Uh. Then they mention organizational skills. They want someone who's well organized."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Yes, uh, I think I am."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"And tidy?"},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Yes, they go together really, don't they?"},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Sure. Then the usual stuff, they want someone who can communicate well both orally and in writing."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"OK, and for the last warehouse job I had, one of the things I enjoyed most was being part of a team. I found that was really essential for the job."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Excellent. Yes, they do mention that they want someone who's used to that, yes. Now, when you were working in a warehouse last time, what sorts of items were you dealing with?"},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"It was mostly bathroom and kitchen equipment, sinks and stoves and fridges."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"So you're OK moving heavy things?"},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Sure. I'm quite strong, and I've had the training."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"Good. Now, as far as experience goes, they mention they want someone with a license, and that you have experience of driving in London. So you can cope with the traffic and so on."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Yes, no problem."},
              {sp:"SALLY", t:"And you've got experience of warehouse work. And the final thing they mention is customer service, I think looking at your cv, you're OK there."},
              {sp:"JOE", t:"Right. So what about pay? Can you tell me a bit more about that please?"},
              {sp:"ANNOUNCER", t:"That is the end of part 1. You now have one minute to check your answers to part 1."}
            ]
